---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Scope">
	<h1>Scope</h1>

	<h2>What DAL Is</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>A formal specification for declaring decision authority</li>
		<li>Focused on governance, not implementation</li>
		<li>Applicable to systems involving humans, automated agents, or both</li>
		<li>Designed for auditability and inspection</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>What DAL Is Not</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Not an enforcement mechanism</li>
		<li>Not a decision-making framework</li>
		<li>Not an ethics or alignment system</li>
		<li>Not a product, platform, or tool</li>
		<li>Not a replacement for human responsibility</li>
	</ul>

	<p style="margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding-top: 1rem;">
		Definitions, conformance requirements, and normative language are defined exclusively in the <a href="https://blockchaination.github.io/decision-authority-layer/spec/">specification</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
